#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:4
msgid "v2.2.0"
msgstr "v2.2.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.2.0 introduces **AprilTags support** (``image.find_apriltags()``), "
"enables **CAN2** on the OpenMV 2 / 3, adds extra MicroPython modules, "
"restores Pixy emulation callbacks, and aligns the REPL Ctrl-D/C/A handling "
"with standard MicroPython boards. It introduces **no breaking API changes** "
"— v2.1.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v2.2.0 uvodi **podršku za AprilTags** (\\ ``image.find_apriltags()``\\ ), "
"omogućuje **CAN2** na OpenMV 2 / 3, dodaje dodatne MicroPython module, vraća"
" povratne pozive za emulaciju Pixyja i usklađuje rukovanje s Ctrl-D/C/A u "
"REPL-u sa standardnim MicroPython pločama. Ne uvodi **nikakve promjene API-"
"ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — skripte za v2.1.0 rade nepromijenjene."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:20
msgid "**AprilTags** — ``image.find_apriltags()`` fiducial-marker detection."
msgstr ""
"**AprilTags** — detekcija referentnih oznaka pomoću "
"``image.find_apriltags()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:21
msgid "**CAN2** — enabled on the OpenMV 2 and OpenMV 3."
msgstr "**CAN2** — omogućen na OpenMV 2 i OpenMV 3."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:22
msgid "**More MicroPython modules** enabled."
msgstr "**Više MicroPython modula** omogućeno."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:23
msgid ""
"**REPL** — Ctrl-D / Ctrl-C / Ctrl-A now behave like standard MicroPython "
"boards."
msgstr ""
"**REPL** — Ctrl-D / Ctrl-C / Ctrl-A sada se ponašaju kao na standardnim "
"MicroPython pločama."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v2.1.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Nema promjena API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — ponovno flashajte "
"i vaše skripte za v2.1.0 rade nepromijenjene."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:29
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:31
msgid ""
"**AprilTags** — added AprilTag fiducial-marker detection "
"(``image.find_apriltags()``), with release/bug fixes."
msgstr ""
"**AprilTags** — dodana detekcija referentnih oznaka AprilTag (\\ "
"``image.find_apriltags()``\\ ), uz ispravke za izdanje i pogreške."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:33
msgid ""
"**CAN2** — enabled CAN2 on the OpenMV 2 / 3 (with CAN init0/de-init in "
"``main``)."
msgstr ""
"**CAN2** — omogućen CAN2 na OpenMV 2 / 3 (s CAN init0/de-init u ``main``\\ "
")."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:35
msgid ""
"Enabled additional MicroPython modules and restored the Pixy-emulation "
"callbacks."
msgstr ""
"Omogućeni dodatni MicroPython moduli i vraćeni povratni pozivi za emulaciju "
"Pixyja."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:39
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:41
msgid ""
"The REPL now handles Ctrl-D / Ctrl-C / Ctrl-A the same way as standard "
"MicroPython boards; updated the face-detection and face-tracking example "
"scripts."
msgstr ""
"REPL sada rukuje s Ctrl-D / Ctrl-C / Ctrl-A na isti način kao standardne "
"MicroPython ploče; ažurirane su primjeri skripti za detekciju i praćenje "
"lica."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:46
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci pogrešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:48
msgid ""
"Fixed QR-code decoding bugs, the Haar cascade step, and the bootloader LED."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljene su pogreške u dekodiranju QR kodova, korak Haar cascade i LED "
"pokretača (bootloader)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:51
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardver i podrška za ploče"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:53
msgid "**OpenMV 2 / 3** — CAN2 enabled; added an SWD-programmer flag."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV 2 / 3** — omogućen CAN2; dodana je zastavica za SWD programator."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:56
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.2.0.rst:58
msgid ""
"v2.2.0 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v2.1.0 run unchanged on v2.2.0 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v2.2.0 ne uvodi **nikakve promjene Python API-ja koje narušavaju "
"kompatibilnost**\\ . Skripte koje su radile na v2.1.0 rade nepromijenjene na"
" v2.2.0 — samo ponovno flashajte ugrađeni program (firmware)."
